{
  "title": "Yellowed Garlic Ukrainian Pasta Pilaf",
  "description": "A garlicky and nostalgic Ukrainian dish featuring dried cherries and a pasta water emulsion, served on a cedar plank. This dairy free friendly pilaf is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Ukrainian",
  "diet": [
    "dairy-free",
